{
  "_read": "Scenix brand tokens. Every length here is a pixel measured on the 1920x1080 TV mockup; the web client multiplies each one by min(viewportW/1920, viewportH/1080) at runtime, so a 720p TV and a 1080p TV get the same design rather than a different one. Colours with any transparency are written rgba(r,g,b,a), never eight-digit hex: #AARRGGBB and #RRGGBBAA are the same six letters read two different ways, and only one of them is CSS. Both this page and the Android shell parse rgba(), so a token file can be copied between them without anything tinting. app.css carries these values as its defaults and /ui/js/theme.js re-applies them from here — edit a number in this file, reload the page, the whole interface moves.",
